Z||000003||Mark||03-17-2001||09:58 PM||||I got mine at Auto Zone and Advance Auto Parts.  Between these two stores, they had all 5 hoses (including the two up front) in stock. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||ray b||03-17-2001||10:42 PM||||take old one to store and find two that bend right so they can be used to make one with a piece of tubing to join them in the middle. thats what i did.||||reg||1
